Welcome to my blog! Here I'll be sharing my development experience, architectural decisions and useful tools.

## Why I started blogging

As a frontend architect with more than 7 years of experience, I've accumulated a lot of knowledge that I want to share with the developer community.

## What's coming to the blog

- **Architectural patterns** — how to build scalable applications
- **Tools** — reviews and comparisons of technologies
- **Case studies** — breakdowns of real projects
- **Tips** — productivity hacks

## The tech stack behind this blog

This blog is built on:

```typescript
const stack = {
  framework: 'Next.js 16',
  ui: 'Chakra UI v3',
  cms: 'Keystatic',
  content: 'MDX',
  database: 'PostgreSQL + Prisma',
}
```

Subscribe and follow the updates!
